    handsOnEn: "Complete the Practical exercise at the end of this page: implement a minimal version of code execution, save a successful trace, a recoverable-failure trace, and an escalation trace, then write one regression test per trace and compare against a direct-generation baseline.",
    handsOnZh: "完成本页末尾的「实践练习」：为「代码执行」实现一个最小可行版本，保存三条轨迹——一次成功的运行、一次可恢复的失败、以及一个必须停止或上报的案例——为每条轨迹编写一个回归测试，并与直接生成的基线进行比较。",
